<title>GERMANY: Schering - European Q1 betaferon sales rise.</title>
<headline>Schering - European Q1 betaferon sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    European betaferon sales		 75     vs n/a</p>
<p>    U.S. betaferon sales		     77     vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pharmaceuticals group is Schering AG. Schering said European sales of the multiple sclerosis drug betaferon had about tripled in the first three months of the year compared with the year-earlier level. It said U.S. sales were about steady from the year ago level.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
